# The <2x2x2:7> level's product program (DPS's dyadic accurate point, see dps7_L.slp): 7 products
# -> 4 blocks of C; o0 = C11, o1 = C12, o2 = C21, o3 = C22.  Cancellation-free, 11 additions and
# 3 scalings by powers of two.
t1:=i2-i4;
t2:=t1/2;
t3:=i0-t2;
t4:=i2+i4;
t5:=t4/4;
t6:=i1-i3;
t7:=t6+i5;
t8:=t7+i6;
t9:=t8/2;
t10:=t5+t9;
t11:=i1-i5;
t12:=t11+t3;
t13:=i3+i6;
t14:=t13+t3;
o0:=t10;
o1:=t12;
o2:=t14;
o3:=t4;
